{"method":"session.event","params":{"event":{"data":{"message":{"content":[{"text":"## Finalization emission\n\nThe fix has two parts:\n\n- **Live region** — streaming stays pre-wrapped and erasable; nothing commits while in flight.\n- **Commit** — finished logical lines go to scrollback via `tea.Println`, unwrapped, autowrap on.\n\nThe terminal soft-wraps committed lines itself, so native selection-copy re-joins them and resize reflows history. Each committed line ends with `CSI K` to clear stale row tails left by the live region.\n\n```go\nfunc commit(line string) tea.Cmd {\n\treturn tea.Println(line + \"\\x1b[K\")\n}\n```\n\n> Styles never nest; islands only. *Copy fidelity wins.*","type":"text"}],"id":"a2","role":"assistant","source":{"kind":"model","model":"qwen/qwen3.8-max","provider":"deepseek-official"}},"step":1,"turn":2,"usage":{"cacheReadTokens":1024,"inputTokens":2113,"outputTokens":221,"reasoningTokens":64}},"seq":49,"sourceEventSeqs":[43,44,45,46,47,48],"surfaceOp":"append","time":1786924264200,"type":"assistant/message"},"sessionId":"session-b806104375973896"}}
